// Secrets.xcconfig.template
//
// Copy this file to Config/Secrets.xcconfig (gitignored) and fill in the key.
// Config/Shared.xcconfig picks it up automatically via `#include?`.
//
//     cp Config/Secrets.xcconfig.template Config/Secrets.xcconfig
//
// The Dropbox app key identifies Auster's entry in the Dropbox developer
// console. It is not a secret in the cryptographic sense — OAuth uses PKCE, so
// there is no client secret in the app (decisions.md D3) — but it is
// per-developer, so it stays out of the repository.
//
// Ask Josh for the value.

DROPBOX_APP_KEY = your_dropbox_app_key_here
